"\n"
"## Platforms\n"
"\n"
"Native and site-generator targets, emitted by the CLI or their own API.\n"
"\n"
"| "
"Package                                                                                        "
"| Output                                     |\n"
"| "
"---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- "
"| ------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/swift`](/api/platforms/swift/"
"src/)                                                 | Swift source plus a "
"SwiftPM manifest stub. |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/android`](/api/platforms/android/"
"src/)                                             | Android XML "
"resources.                     |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/compose`](/api/platforms/compose/"
"src/)                                             | Jetpack Compose "
"Kotlin.                    |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/flutter`](/api/platforms/flutter/"
"src/)                                             | Flutter "
"Dart.                              |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/rust`](/api/platforms/rust/"
"src/)                                                   | Rust consts for "
"egui or iced.              |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/wordpress`](/api/platforms/wordpress/"
"src/)                                         | A WordPress block-theme "
"`theme.json`.      |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/vanilla`](/api/platforms/vanilla/"
"src/)                                             | A Vanilla Forums "
"`variables.json`.         |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/drupal`](/api/platforms/drupal/"
"src/)                                               | Drupal theme "
"assets.                       |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/hugo`](/api/platforms/hugo/src/), [`@pantoken/jekyll`](/api/"
"platforms/jekyll/src/) | Hugo and Jekyll site data.                 |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/email`](/api/platforms/email/"
"src/)                                                 | Inline-friendly "
"values for HTML email.     |\n"
"\n"
"## Design\n"
"\n"
"For design tools.\n"
"\n"
"| Package                                           | "
"Output                                                                |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------- | "
"--------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/figma`](/api/design/figma/src/)       | A Figma Variables "
"payload.                                            |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/swatches`](/api/design/swatches/src/) | Color swatches (ASE, "
"GPL, Sketch) plus a viewable SVG specimen sheet. |\n"
"\n"
"## Plugins\n"
"\n"
"Optional transforms that extend the token or CSS output. See [Plugins](/"
"guide/plugins).\n"
"\n"
"| "
"Package                                                                               "
"| What it adds                                                    |\n"
"| "
"------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- "
"| --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/plugin-stacking`](/api/plugins/pantoken/stacking/"
"src/)                    | Named z-index depths as `--instui-stacking-*` "
"tokens.           |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug`](/api/plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/"
"src/)            | The `-with-visual-debug` layout-debugging "
"outline.              |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/plugin-simple-icons`](/api/plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/"
"src/)            | Brand icons from simple-"
"icons.                                  |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/plugin-logos`](/api/plugins/pantoken/logos/"
"src/)                          | Instructure product logos as SVGs, data "
"URIs, and image tokens. |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props`](/api/plugins/postcss/prune-custom-"
"props/src/) | A PostCSS plugin that drops unused custom "
"properties.           |\n"
"\n"
"## Tools\n"
"\n"
"Build, docs, and demo infrastructure for the monorepo itself. Most is "
"internal, but the pieces are\n"
"self-contained, so we document them here and some ship to npm on their own.\n"
"\n"
"| Package                                            | What it "
"does                                                                                                                                                                                          "
"|\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------- | "
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- "
"|\n"
"| [`@pantoken/aggregate`](/api/tools/aggregate/src/) | Generates the unified "
"`pantoken` package barrel and `exports` from its "
"dependencies.                                                                                                                  "
"|\n"
"| `@pantoken/validate-generated`                     | The drift gate: "
"checks every generated stylesheet resolves against the token "
"IR.                                                                                                                      "
"|\n"
